<title>USA: Katz says approached for potential deal.</title>
<headline>Katz says approached for potential deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katz Media Group Inc said Monday it has been approached &quot;by a number of parties regarding a potential corporate transaction.&quot;</p>
<p>Katz, which sells national radio and television advertising time, said no agreement has been reached and there is no assurance it will enter into any agreement.</p>
<p>The company said it issued the statement due to unusual market activity in its stock.</p>
</text>
